  "commemorates": "Delta's partnership with the Breast Cancer Research Foundation (BCRF).",
  "description": "Delta's white scheme with the navy belly and standard fin, wrapped in a pink ribbon: a ribbon loop round the forward fuselage behind the forward door, its strands running down and back to the belly, and a broad pink swoosh (shading pink to red) from the crown ahead of the fin down to the wing root. 'DELTA' with the widget forward; 'BCRF' with a small pink ribbon and 'Breast Cancer Research Foundation' under the cockpit.",
