      "title": "Delta Flight Museum: special liveries",
      "accessed": "2026-11-22",
      "note": "Ship 1821 (N845MH) first wore pink in 2010; repainted in 2015 with the pink ribbon wrapped round the fuselage, for the Breast Cancer Research Foundation."
    },
    {
